{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"极大权模"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"“极大权模”"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>$U\\mathfrak g$-模 $M$ 称作极大权模是指: 它由一个极大权向量 $v_+$ 循环生成, 且 $\\mathfrak nv_+=0$.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>极大权模等价于 "},{"Local":{"url":"Verma模","text":"Verma 模"}},{"Plain":"的商.</p>\n"}]}}